`,(0,n.jsx)(r.p,{children:"This request uses multiple FactSet datasets to build a complete equity research report. Claude retrieves historical pricing to show performance trends, pulls standardized fundamentals for year-over-year comparisons, incorporates forward-looking consensus estimates, and adds governance context through insider activity. The peer comparison ensures relative valuation context using FactSet's standardized metrics."}),`
